### [1] 3f email
$ xargs grep -noE '[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}' <publishable files>
(end)

### [1] 3g em dash
$ xargs grep -n <em-dash char> <publishable files>
(end)

### [1] 3g en dash
$ xargs grep -n <en-dash char> <publishable files>
(end)

### [1] 3h net terms
$ xargs grep -niE 'bonjour|mdns|tailnet|tailscale|serial|deviceId|pairing|mac address' <publishable files>
