(end)

### [2] 3f first-name-fragment
$ xargs grep -ni <first-name-fragment> <publishable files>
(end)

### [2] 3f hostnames/usernames
$ xargs grep -niE 'mac-?(mini|studio)|<user>|etzel' <publishable files>
